---

<section
  class="bg-gray-900 text-white border-b-2 border-gray-900 py-16 lg:py-24"
>
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <p
          class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-500 mb-2"
        >
          Launch Stacks
        </p>
        <h2
          class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-6"
        >
          Pick your stack, deploy locally.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Combine a local LLM with a RAG pipeline, a vector database, and an API
          gateway — all self-hosted, all no-call-home. We curate compatible
          toolchains so you don't have to hunt dependencies.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold text-gray-300">
            <span
              class="w-5 h-5 bg-primary-500 border-2 border-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 text-xs font-black flex-shrink-0"
              aria-hidden="true">✓</span
            >
            LLM + RAG + Vector DB combos
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold text-gray-300">
            <span
              class="w-5 h-5 bg-primary-500 border-2 border-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 text-xs font-black flex-shrink-0"
              aria-hidden="true">✓</span
            >
            One-click hardware requirement estimates
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold text-gray-300">
            <span
              class="w-5 h-5 bg-primary-500 border-2 border-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-900 text-xs font-black flex-shrink-0"
              aria-hidden="true">✓</span
            >
            Verified compatibility matrices
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a
          href="/stack-builder"
          class="inline-flex items-center h-12 border-2 border-gray-900 px-6 font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-xs bg-white text-gray-900 hover:bg-primary-500 hover:text-white hover:border-primary-500 transition-all no-underline"
        >
          Explore Launch Stacks <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-2">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-900 p-6 lg:p-8 text-gray-900">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary-100 border-2 border-primary-500 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm"
          >
            RK
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-black text-gray-900 text-sm">Rajan K.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold">
              VP of Infrastructure, FinTech
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 font-medium text-base leading-relaxed">
          "We needed an internal RAG tool for compliance documents. Enclave
          Tools matched us with three self-hosted options in under an hour.
          Every suggestion had a license we could defend."
        </p>
        <div
          class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t-2 border-gray-900 flex items-center justify-between"
        >
          <span
            class="text-xs font-black text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider"
            >Audience Risk Level</span
          >
          <span
            class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary-100 border-2 border-primary-500 text-primary-700 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider"
            >High — Regulated</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
